        <title>Nevermore</title>
        <item>
            <title>1.0.0</title>
            <description><![CDATA[
                <p>The version number catching up to what the app is: no known
                data-loss bugs, and a verified sandboxed build. The app is
                unchanged from 0.1.1.</p>
                <ul>
                  <li>Nevermore is now on the Mac App Store, listed as
                  "Nevermore Mail Cleanup". This direct-download build is the
                  same app and keeps updating itself.</li>
                  <li>Support now has its own page, with an email address, so
                  getting help never requires a GitHub account.</li>
                </ul>
            ]]></description>
            <pubDate>Sat, 01 Aug 2026 21:50:59 -0700</pubDate>
