        <item>
            <title>0.1.1</title>
            <description><![CDATA[
                <p>Packaging and documentation. The app itself is unchanged
                from 0.1.0.</p>
                <ul>
                  <li>The app inside the disk image now carries its own stapled
                  notarization ticket, so an update installs cleanly on a Mac
                  that is offline or behind a filter.</li>
                  <li>The privacy policy is published at
                  brooksc.github.io/Nevermore/privacy.html, and now describes
                  this update check.</li>
                </ul>
            ]]></description>
